NOTICE
======

This project includes files ported from other projects:

- `src/gate/verdict.ts`: verbatim copy of Heretek-AI/IUMBTEMS
  `packages/core/src/evals/gate.ts` (Apache-2.0), with only an added header
  comment. Provides `decideGateVerdict` and `parseAcknowledgments`.
- `src/gate/exit.ts`: verbatim copy of Heretek-AI/IUMBTEMS
  `packages/core/src/evals/exit.ts` (Apache-2.0), with only an added header
  comment. Provides `decideEvalsExit` (required by the ported gate tests).
