  orchestration, ported from Heretek-AI/IUMBTEMS `scripts/e2e-gate.ts`
  (Apache-2.0) and adapted (async injectable `gh` runner; absent
  acknowledgments file defaults to empty per SPEC/M12 rather than failing;
  see `docs/NOTES.md`).
